      "title": "5. Mask Detailer",
      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "The rest is similar to what was introduced in the Detailer for AnimateDiff tutorial. \nCreate a Detailer workflow.\n\nFor the \"basic_pipe,\" set the prompt as \"1girl, hair shakes,\" and for Detailer For AnimateDiff, input the still image expanded to 16 frames as \"image_frames.\"\n\nConnect \"MASK to SEGS,\" and the cinemagraph video with selectively moving parts will be created by redrawing only the masked area.\n\nLet's run the image workflow with the \"queue prompt.\"\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "The rest is similar to what was introduced in the Detailer for AnimateDiff tutorial. \nCreate a Detailer workflow.\n\nFor the \"basic_pipe,\" set the prompt as \"1girl, hair shakes,\" and for Detailer For AnimateDiff, input the still image expanded to 16 frames as \"image_frames.\"\n\nConnect \"MASK to SEGS,\" and the cinemagraph video with selectively moving parts will be created by redrawing only the masked area.\n\nLet's run the image workflow with the \"queue prompt.\"\n"
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
